# Cursor's local workspace state, saved plans included. Not dogfood-install output —
# cairn-verify.yml installs claude-code and codex only — but `cairn agent install
# --target cursor` writes .cursor/{skills,agents,rules,hooks.json,mcp.json}, and the
# Plan editor writes .cursor/plans/. All of it is local working state: a plan is a
# scratch artifact for whoever generated it, not something the repository carries.
.cursor/
.cursor-plugin/
